  "scientific_review": [
    "All seven declared Guinea Current sections were acquired at exact January15 and July15,2022 00Z. All14 section-date cases remain, including unselected, edge or censored cases. Native profiles, components, coordinates, indices, hyperslabs, attributes, candidate integral flags and threshold layers are retained unchanged from cloud artifacts.",
    "Frozen transverse v2 acquisition and its component, selector, connected-layer and geometry helpers were reused without changing numerical rules. Forty cloud tests passed in groups12/11/8/5/4, followed by recomputation and audit of every actual retained section. Exact failed-component read retries preserve future first-attempt budget and never replay successful other fields; actual attempts are recorded in the ledger.",
    "Primary10cm/s, surface>5cm/s, fixed eastward90degree component and complete finite native0–200m integral support were declared before acquisition. Shallow shelf columns without complete upper200m support cannot qualify; this can omit coastal flow and is not evidence that it is absent. A broad-gate model maximum does not independently establish named-current membership. Selected gate/support edges stay unresolved rather than selecting a weaker interior substitute.",
    "Alory2021 publisher HTML was freshly reviewed. Source summer model/ADCP vertical sections distinguish upper50m Guinea Current from Guinea Counter Current, Guinea Under Current and equatorial SEC; model/observational positions and depths differ. Historical seasonal climatology is not imposed on2022 snapshots. Source upper50m description,100m figure extent and prior approximate200km model width are not physical bottoms, matched widths or uncertainty endpoints.",
    "Cape Palmas approach to2E is a partial editorial regional convention. The seven longitude and latitude windows are OSW exploratory choices, not digitized source axes, independently verified current paths, measured widths or uncertainty bands. Upstream NECC, adjacent westward currents, plume recirculation and detached eddies remain distinct targets and possible contamination limitations.",
    "All retrieval, selection, contour/geometry calculations, transport retries and tests ran sequentially in the cloud on one idle CPU. Local work prepared metadata/code, reviewed source text, verified hashes and retained exact artifact bytes. No local numerical ocean-field processing/tests or runtime/UI work. Original file, aggregate and inline publication caps remain unchanged.",
    "Two snapshots are not monthly means, seasonal envelopes, annual extrema or independent observations. Threshold layers remain qualified model diagnostics, not physical whole-current thickness. Canonical depth registerv48, regional projection inventoryv6 and102-size-referenced eddy baseline remain unchanged by this source retention. No volume, full physical depth profile, matched width or state join is admitted. Projection must retain every original section and gap."
